 "title": "The Nazi Rocket Dome",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🚀",
 "sentences": [
  "This massive concrete dome was a secret Nazi base.",
  "Known as La Coupole, it was built in northern France between 1943 and 1944.",
  "The site was designed to launch V-2 rockets against London on an industrial scale.",
  "Workers constructed it inside a disused chalk quarry.",
  "It features a network of tunnels for storing missiles and fuel.",
  "This bunker is the earliest known precursor to modern underground missile silos."
